  "notes": [
    "Regular -AR verb — follows standard -AR endings with no exceptions",
    "Past participle: *dañado* (regular)",
    "Means \"to damage\" or \"to harm\" (physically, emotionally, or materially) — *la lluvia dañó el techo* (the rain damaged the roof), *sus palabras la dañaron* (his words hurt her)",
    "Reflexive *dañarse* means \"to get damaged\" or \"to hurt oneself\": *el fruto se dañó con el calor* (the fruit got damaged by the heat)",
    "Related: *daño* (damage, harm — noun; *hacer daño* = to hurt), *dañino/a* (harmful), *dañado/a* (damaged)"
  ],
